"RSLT", "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n7le02ob07re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Now it's your turn to find information about software license agreement. "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le02ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: Hey! What are you up? Are you helping me with my task then? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Sure. Software licenses are my thing. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: So, let's start. Why are they so important for business? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Because companies ought to be informed about the different risks and remedies involved when getting software products. Some license agreements are non-negotiable, that's why they present little risk, but others are negotiable and ought to be stipulated. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: And the potential licensee needs to consider if the vendor's agreement is appropriate and suitable for the customer. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Exactly! So both have very clear idea of what the product offers."}, {"time": "43000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: What are the goals that are achieved by negotiating software licenses? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Well, liability ought to be reduced with the proper provisions. Testing rights should be considered cautiously and the ongoing software performance ought to be addressed as described by the vendor previously. Besides, the scope of the license must be expanded as necessary to cover the software needs. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: That's it? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Also, risks associated with data breach and how to solve them ought to be studied. The termination rights need to be clearly stipulated and provided. And what's more, in case of force majeure events, vendors are off the hook. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: What about the dispute resolution? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: It has to be considered appropriately based on a fair evaluation by both parties."}, {"time": "94000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: Do you know about the factors to consider when a legal review is required? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Yes! For instance, cost ought to be analyzed. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: To see how much the licensee spends on the software. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Correct! The impact has to be considered as well, to know the performance towards the business. Finally, sensitivity ought to be analyzed. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Hillary</span>: You're the best! I owe you one."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le02ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}